
BTW ==== TESTKIT: helpers para escribir tests en LOLCODE ====

I HAS A TPASS ITZ 0
I HAS A TFAIL ITZ 0

HOW IZ I REPORT YR NAM AN YR OK
  OK, O RLY?
    YA RLY
      VISIBLE "PASS "!
VISIBLE NAM
      TPASS R SUM OF TPASS AN 1
    NO WAI
      VISIBLE "FAIL "!
VISIBLE NAM
      TFAIL R SUM OF TFAIL AN 1
  OIC
  FOUND YR 1
IF U SAY SO

HOW IZ I EXPECT YR NAM AN YR GOT AN YR WANT
  I HAS A OK ITZ BOTH SAEM GOT AN WANT
  I HAS A RRQ ITZ I IZ REPORT YR NAM AN YR OK MKAY
  BOTH SAEM OK AN FAIL, O RLY?
    YA RLY
      VISIBLE "    got="!
VISIBLE GOT
      VISIBLE "    want="!
VISIBLE WANT
  OIC
  FOUND YR OK
IF U SAY SO

HOW IZ I EXPECTYARN YR NAM AN YR GOT AN YR WANT
  FOUND YR I IZ EXPECT YR NAM AN YR GOT AN YR WANT MKAY
IF U SAY SO

BTW MKLINE1..8: arma una linea fuente a partir de chars (para tests)
HOW IZ I MKLINE1 YR C1
  I HAS A L ITZ I IZ MKBUKKIT MKAY
  L HAS A SRS 0 ITZ C1
  FOUND YR L
IF U SAY SO
HOW IZ I MKLINE2 YR C1 AN YR C2
  I HAS A L ITZ I IZ MKLINE1 YR C1 MKAY
  L HAS A SRS 1 ITZ C2
  FOUND YR L
IF U SAY SO
HOW IZ I MKLINE3 YR C1 AN YR C2 AN YR C3
  I HAS A L ITZ I IZ MKLINE2 YR C1 AN YR C2 MKAY
  L HAS A SRS 2 ITZ C3
  FOUND YR L
IF U SAY SO
HOW IZ I MKLINE4 YR C1 AN YR C2 AN YR C3 AN YR C4
  I HAS A L ITZ I IZ MKLINE3 YR C1 AN YR C2 AN YR C3 MKAY
  L HAS A SRS 3 ITZ C4
  FOUND YR L
IF U SAY SO
HOW IZ I MKLINE5 YR C1 AN YR C2 AN YR C3 AN YR C4 AN YR C5
  I HAS A L ITZ I IZ MKLINE4 YR C1 AN YR C2 AN YR C3 AN YR C4 MKAY
  L HAS A SRS 4 ITZ C5
  FOUND YR L
IF U SAY SO
HOW IZ I MKLINE6 YR C1 AN YR C2 AN YR C3 AN YR C4 AN YR C5 AN YR C6
  I HAS A L ITZ I IZ MKLINE5 YR C1 AN YR C2 AN YR C3 AN YR C4 AN YR C5 MKAY
  L HAS A SRS 5 ITZ C6
  FOUND YR L
IF U SAY SO
HOW IZ I MKLINE7 YR C1 AN YR C2 AN YR C3 AN YR C4 AN YR C5 AN YR C6 AN YR C7
  I HAS A L ITZ I IZ MKLINE6 YR C1 AN YR C2 AN YR C3 AN YR C4 AN YR C5 AN YR C6 MKAY
  L HAS A SRS 6 ITZ C7
  FOUND YR L
IF U SAY SO
HOW IZ I MKLINE8 YR C1 AN YR C2 AN YR C3 AN YR C4 AN YR C5 AN YR C6 AN YR C7 AN YR C8
  I HAS A L ITZ I IZ MKLINE7 YR C1 AN YR C2 AN YR C3 AN YR C4 AN YR C5 AN YR C6 AN YR C7 MKAY
  L HAS A SRS 7 ITZ C8
  FOUND YR L
IF U SAY SO

BTW FEEDLINE: entrega una linea (bukkit) al parser
HOW IZ I FEEDLINE YR LBUF AN YR LLEN
  LINE R LBUF
  LN R LLEN
  I HAS A RRQ ITZ I IZ LINEHANDLE MKAY
  FOUND YR RRQ
IF U SAY SO

BTW PUSHCH/ENDLINE: escribe una linea caracter a caracter, como el driver
BTW de transporte lo haria con el stream; la misma LINE queda armada.
BTW TRUCO lci: pasar una yarn ":" como ultimo argumento de una funcion
BTW dispara un lexer bug de lci (se traga la comilla de cierre y sigue).
BTW Workaround demostrado: GETCOLON anida la llamada y devuelve ":" limpio.
HOW IZ I GETCOLON
  FOUND YR ":"
IF U SAY SO

HOW IZ I PUSHCOLON
  I HAS A C ITZ I IZ GETCOLON MKAY
  I HAS A RQ ITZ I IZ PUSHCH YR C MKAY
  FOUND YR RQ
IF U SAY SO
HOW IZ I PUSHCH YR C
  LINE HAS A SRS LN ITZ C
  LN R SUM OF LN AN 1
  FOUND YR 1
IF U SAY SO

HOW IZ I ENDLINE
  I HAS A RRQ ITZ I IZ LINEHANDLE MKAY
  I HAS A FLINE ITZ I IZ MKBUKKIT MKAY
  LINE R FLINE
  LN R 0
  FOUND YR RRQ
IF U SAY SO


